stomer service directly. For anything about your order, <a href="/pages/contact-us" style="text-decoration: underline;">contact us</a>.</p></div><div style="margin-top: 60px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px;"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px;">Still have questions?</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">We usually reply within 1-2 business days.</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px;"><a href="/pages/contact-us" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; background: rgb(88, 81, 40); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;">Contact Us</a><a href="/pages/faqs" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;">Read the FAQ</a></div></div></div></div></section>
